CEWL Command
cat file1.txt file2.txt file3.txt > combined_list.txt #combines the wordlists into one
sort combined_list.txt | uniq -u > cleaned_combined_list.txt #remove duplicated words
cewl -w list.txt -d 5 -m 5 http://thm.labs
-w: will write the contents into a file
-m 5 :take strings that are more than 5 characters
-d 5 :depth level of crawling
